         // See docs/EMBEDDING.md for a list of possible settings.
 
+        // EXPERIMENT: ?decode=bitmap|img forces core/display.js's decode
+        // path regardless of browser auto-detection, for A/B testing
+        // decode latency on the same machine/browser. Must be set before
+        // UI.start() constructs the RFB (and therefore the Display).
